/-!
# Multi-scale sparse domination, §1: setup

This file was automatically generated by Claude.

Definitions from §1 of D. Beltran, J. Roos, A. Seeger, *Multi-scale sparse domination*,
Mem. Amer. Math. Soc. (2024), arXiv:2009.00227 (TeX lines 409–533):

